  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.110 - fixer runtime-contract suite is now self-auditing (no rule ID or severity changes)\n - Every applied code fix must now leave its own diagnostic cleared; a per-scenario check fails when a declared behaviour also passes on the unfixed mapping\n - Nine runtime-contract scenarios rebuilt around inputs where fixed and unfixed output differ (AM003/AM004/AM005/AM021/AM022/AM030/AM031/AM050/AM061)\n - No analyzer behaviour changes",
